  "description": "Nahyeon joins a dawn swim class to conquer her water phobia—and crushes hard on her hot instructor, Jaehwan. She shuts it down fast. No point eyeing a tree she can't climb. But what if that tree wants to be climbed? Before she knows it, Jaehwan is insisting she take responsibility for taking his virginity!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13631945), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498026359), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/swimming_lesson), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/swim_lesson_log), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077735) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[English](https://manta.net/en/series/swimming-lesson-record-full-ver?seriesId=4493)",
